

Rebased on ps3recomp v0.15.0 (SPU pass 81): rebased onto PR290 per-context slot list, ctx mfc_cache fast path kept, cleared in spu_mfc_release.

Rebased on ps3recomp v0.17.0 (SPU pass 95): #381's SPU_PCSAMPLE thread kept; its starter moved into mfc_for_slow so the cached fast path is unchanged.

Rebased on ps3recomp v0.18.0 (SPU pass 108): upstream's drain refactor kept (`spu_task_launch_check_inline`, `spu_drain_hop_inline`, SPU_DIRECT init) with the history ring per context (no TLS); mfc_for = 1017's ctx cache in front of upstream's (opt-in TLS) lookup; stack-reset check = upstream's (same idea).

